1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,164
Add each to sodium hydroxide solution.

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:08,294
Ethanol just mixes, with no reaction at all: it is no acid.

3
00:00:08,294 --> 00:00:13,111
But phenol dissolves completely, reacting with the alkali like an acid.

4
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:14,596
It even burns skin.

